    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3" root="اب" body-key="A">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَأَبَّهُ</span></b>  <i>He adopted him as a father;</i> an
extr. form; (IAar, M;) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبٌّ</span>, a dial. var. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبٌ</span>: (TA:) regularly, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَأْبَاهُ</span>. (M.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استأبّ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبًا</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَأْبَبَ أَبًا</span> <i>He adopted a father.</i> (TA in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابو</span>.)

